<title>SWEDEN: Saab Aircraft says Japan orders 5 planes.</title>
<headline>Saab Aircraft says Japan orders 5 planes.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAAB Aircraft AB said on Thursday that Japan's civil aviation bureau had ordered five Saab 2000 turbo prop planes.</p>
